ent Flow#Fetch Search Results action#Output variables":[75,85],"#Get AutoFocus Session Info Enrichment Flow#Fetch Search Results action#Output variables#{1}":[77,85],"#Get AutoFocus Session Info Enrichment Flow#Related":[86,91],"#Get AutoFocus Session Info Enrichment Flow#Related#{1}":[88,88],"#Get AutoFocus Session Info Enrichment Flow#Related#{2}":[89,89],"#Get AutoFocus Session Info Enrichment Flow#Related#{3}":[90,91]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Security Operations","target":"security-operations-landing-page","line":24},{"title":"Indicators of Compromise","target":"c_IoCs","line":38},{"title":"Common Security Operations integration flows and orchestration activities","target":"common-wf-activities","line":44},{"title":"AutoFocus Search Session action","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/security-incident-response/search-for-malicious-content.md","line":73},{"title":"Common Security Operations integration flows and orchestration activities","target":"common-wf-activities","line":88},{"title":"Security Operations","target":"security-operations-landing-page","line":89},{"title":"Indicators of compromise","target":"c_IoCs","line":90}],"metadata":{"title":"Get AutoFocus Session Info Enrichment Flow","description":"When the Security Operations Palo Alto Networks- Get AutoFocus Session Info Enrichment flow is executed, it queues a search query with AutoFocus for gathering information about a specified source IP. If AutoFocus has knowledge about previous sessions originating from that IP address, a JSON-formatted report is returned.The AutoFocus Search Session flow action uploads information from an IP address assigned to a security incident to AutoFocus and queues it for a search query.The Fetch Search Results flow action fetches search results identified by a cookie to the search query initiated by the AutoFocus Search Session action.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/